(7662781, 1248842, 67145, '<td valign="top">LOVING your edit .. !!! .. <br/>of course some may object to a photo being turned into a painting .. <br/>but i say .. bring it on . !! .. <br/>its just another creative approach .. <br/>we have so many tools at our disposal now regarding photography .. <br/>its not just a photo we can take .. photography has moved into the realms of whatever we want to make it .. of course ppl used to do some very creative things in the darkroom .. ;)<br/> <br/>this might be my fav in the challenge .. <br/>and with said .. kapow .. a big vote . !!! .. :)<br/>oh .. ps .. its not just the edit . its the photograph that i can see thru that edit ..  good one .. :)</td>', 'LOVING your edit .. !!! .. of course some may object to a photo being turned into a painting .. but i say .. bring it on . !! .. its just another creative approach .. we have so many tools at our disposal now regarding photography .. its not just a photo we can take .. photography has moved into the realms of whatever we want to make it .. of course ppl used to do some very creative things in the darkroom .. ;) this might be my fav in the challenge .. and with said .. kapow .. a big vote . !!! .. :)oh .. ps .. its not just the edit . its the photograph that i can see thru that edit ..  good one .. :)', '2020-05-17 01:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
