(7663001, 1249116, 99263, '<td valign="top">Dugald Stewart Monument, Edinburgh. For a moment when I saw this image I thought it was mine that I took in 2012 and processed exactly like this, same sky, same colors, same viewpoint everything. It''s almost 100% identical. I then took a screenshot of your image and put it into Google Search and it''s amazing what comes up. Hundreds of images almost identical to yours...(and mine) many with the same processing and from the same angle, same cloudy sky everything. This monument must be one of the most photographed monuments in Scotland. You did a great job with this, I am actually praising myself here a little bit too then by saying that ;)  Do yourself a favour and put your image into Google Search and see what comes up...you will be amazed.</td>', 'Dugald Stewart Monument, Edinburgh. For a moment when I saw this image I thought it was mine that I took in 2012 and processed exactly like this, same sky, same colors, same viewpoint everything. It''s almost 100% identical. I then took a screenshot of your image and put it into Google Search and it''s amazing what comes up. Hundreds of images almost identical to yours...(and mine) many with the same processing and from the same angle, same cloudy sky everything. This monument must be one of the most photographed monuments in Scotland. You did a great job with this, I am actually praising myself here a little bit too then by saying that ;)  Do yourself a favour and put your image into Google Search and see what comes up...you will be amazed.', '2020-05-18 20:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
