(7663651, 1249164, 33182, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Six years since your last entry!  What have you been up to?  :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>We''ve been busy living life. Last two years I started hiking the NH 48-4,000 footers. Got half of them done so far. I''ve been a slacker. However, I was just up at the place in Franconia Notch we all met up just this past week. Didn''t take any photos though. The person I was with was too out of shape to go far up the trail. lol. The kiddo is going to be starting her senior year at college this fall. The wife and I are working at the same place now...and if you look to the left of the white church at the top of the pic you''d be able to see hour house (if other buildings weren''t in the way). lol. I''ve switched to a lot more video than still photography (almost all hiking videos). Well, that and dashcam videos of idiots driving terribly. Overall life isn''t bad. <br/> <br/>How about you? Been through Franocnia Notch lately? Life treating you good?</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Six years since your last entry!  What have you been up to?  :-)   We''ve been busy living life. Last two years I started hiking the NH 48-4,000 footers. Got half of them done so far. I''ve been a slacker. However, I was just up at the place in Franconia Notch we all met up just this past week. Didn''t take any photos though. The person I was with was too out of shape to go far up the trail. lol. The kiddo is going to be starting her senior year at college this fall. The wife and I are working at the same place now...and if you look to the left of the white church at the top of the pic you''d be able to see hour house (if other buildings weren''t in the way). lol. I''ve switched to a lot more video than still photography (almost all hiking videos). Well, that and dashcam videos of idiots driving terribly. Overall life isn''t bad.  How about you? Been through Franocnia Notch lately? Life treating you good?', '2020-05-23 15:06:25.000000', NULL, 0),
